<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. We are excited to have you join our campus! Below are the steps to apply to ASU.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">1. Complete the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/uga_admissionsapp/">undergraduate admission application</a>. Please review our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/international/future/undergrad%20">admission requirements and application procedures</a>.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">2. Submit the nonrefundable application fee with a credit card. The application fee is $85 (USD). Application fees cannot be waived or transferred to a future application.&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">3. Submit official transcripts from the last three years of high school as well as any additional course work you completed after graduating. Please mail official transcripts to the following address. We cannot accept email or faxed copies of official transcripts or academic documents.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b><u>Mail official transcripts to:</u></b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Undergraduate Admission Services</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Student Services Building</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">1151 S Forest Ave</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Tempe AZ 85287-0112</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">4. Provide proof of English proficiency. Request that your TOEFL or IELTS score be sent directly to ASU. You can also meet the English language proficiency by successfully completing the Advanced 2 Level of the <a href="http://esl.asu.edu/">ASU Global Launch Intensive English</a> program (formerly AECP).</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Please note that some ASU colleges and schools have higher standards for admission into their programs. International applicants must meet the general university admission requirements as well as the appropriate <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/">freshman or transfer college or school requirements of their major</a>.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">I encourage you to log in to <a href="https://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> after you apply and to regularly check your <b>Priority Tasks</b> box to stay up to date with any items you need to complete in order to enroll at ASU. If you have any questions or need assistance, please feel free to contact me or anyone else on the International Admission Services team.&nbsp;</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>